- ✅ Role definition with correct attributes
- ✅ Object type definition with appropriate permissions
- ✅ Rule definition ready for execution after harvest
- ✅ Visibility configured for community transparency
- ✅ Lifecycle specified for role rotation  
- ✅ Prompt directive for agent perspective

